== diags.diag/input-fails-shorthand-forms
BYN1031 4:4 `T!E` is an input form; write `T f() fails E`
  label the input form
  help write `fails E, F` as the last clause of the signature
  fix 4:4-4:18  g() fails E, F
BYN1031 5:4 `T!E` is an input form; write `T f() fails E`
  label the input form
  help write `fails E` as the last clause of the signature
  fix 5:4-5:18  h() fails E
